{"term": {"label": "心", "occurrences": 7, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "五", "id": "五"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}, {"form": "飢", "id": "飢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9947003132247452, "source": "敎", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.6762465821062107, "source": "敎", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.8769172775683618, "source": "敎", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.975529566236472, "source": "敎", "target": "五"}, {"weight": 1.8769172775683618, "source": "敎", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.4069136483226263, "source": "君子", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.6945957207744073, "source": "君子", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.15415067982725836, "source": "君子", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.001448540214462, "source": "君子", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.7137664677626809, "source": "君子", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.1837700970084166, "source": "君子", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 2.1000608288825715, "source": "君子", "target": "五"}, {"weight": 2.1000608288825715, "source": "心", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.8472978603872037, "source": "心", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.6945957207744073, "source": "心", "target": "存"}, {"weight": 0.7137664677626809, "source": "心", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 0.3953127366441464, "source": "心", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.8472978603872037, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.4069136483226263, "source": "心", "t